1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Meet Claim OS: a property-tax appeal company run by agents, built on Naïve.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
It finds over-assessed homes, checks the economics, and prioritizes promising cases.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Then it finds relevant public contacts and prepares personalized outreach.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Every message and reply stays attached to the case.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Owners speak their name, review the document, and confirm their signature.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The filing agent fills the petition and assembles the evidence.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
It submits the packet and saves the receipt for the next step.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Chase keeps following up and updating the case until resolution.

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
When someone requests a licensed professional through the website,

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:59,000
our briefing agent automatically creates a personalized presentation for their property.

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
It explains the numbers, evidence and next steps.

12
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Once a reduction is verified against the revised tax bill, Collect takes over.

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
We only earn a success fee when the owner wins and their tax bill goes down.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:23,000
We invoice through Stripe and collect thirty percent of the verified savings.

15
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
The owner keeps seventy percent. No win, no success fee.

16
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Claim OS. We win when homeowners win.
